lugin.\n\nWe have developed a brand new method and software framework that have several advantages over these current methods. It's cheaper, faster to develop and supports mobile.\n\nCheck it now, on http://overstruct.com", "short_description": "Overstruct Viewer App\n\nYou can view both your and featured Overstruct files with this application.\n\nOverstruct is a PC software for you to create architectural virtual reality walkthroughs automatically and easily, from your existing 3d project files."}]}, "developer_name": "Overstruct", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://overstruct.com/viewer_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://overstruct.com/viewer_terms.html", "publisher_name": "Overstruct", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://overstruct.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PRODUCTIVITY", "SIMULATION", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "343828637430936"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162732_198688150877218_478340639583371264_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LtjGv8CRCi4Q7kNvwGuwl9h&_nc_oc=AdmkVo1MctuvmvQHezxVe9qnHvH3co5sB6NU3avIGPIg-eW_JxAPIi8ndRQB5_nlMHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuiiNkzW5rsM6LDshSNkdJ_DpGZRa50fhtBh8-Urn-XtQ&oe=699C4D15"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Overstruct", "platform": "ANDRO